Upd: actually, one other idea is that the issue is query rehashing the input/storing output to disk. This can easily be fixed by merging _queries_ between `check_unsafety` and this, and that would not make the implementation readability worse (as those, I assume, can still have their own visitors, we only need to merge cache behavior)

